Flush active 2D canvas targets before sharing their buffer provider.

Popup windows can request a canvas buffer provider before the stable-state
callback has returned the current draw target.  If a shared provider is then
retargeted to the popup compositor while its current pixels only exist in the
borrowed draw target, the provider has no front texture to copy and the canvas
is presented as transparent.  This is visible on SPARC as an empty tab-hover
preview thumbnail after the PageThumbs snapshot has been drawn successfully.

Return the draw target before exposing the provider so the provider's front
buffer is current for compositor handoff.

This is kept as a separate canvas handoff patch and guarded for Solaris/SPARC,
where the shared chrome canvas path is required for tab preview rendering.

Dependency: apply before SPARC-11-snapshot-shared-canvas-textures.patch. This
patch makes the provider handoff expose current canvas pixels; the later
snapshot patch changes how those shared pixels are forwarded to WebRender.

--- firefox-153.0/dom/canvas/CanvasRenderingContext2D.cpp
+++ firefox-153.0/dom/canvas/CanvasRenderingContext2D.cpp
@@ -2057,6 +2057,15 @@ return true;
 }
 
 PersistentBufferProvider* CanvasRenderingContext2D::GetBufferProvider() {
+#if defined(XP_SOLARIS) && (defined(__sparc) || defined(__sparc__))
+  if (mTarget && mBufferProvider && mTarget != sErrorTarget.get()) {
+    // The compositor may request the provider before the stable-state callback
+    // has returned the current draw target. Return it now so shared providers
+    // have a current front buffer when a canvas moves between compositors, such
+    // as into a popup window.
+    ReturnTarget();
+  }
+#endif
   if (mBufferProvider && mBufferNeedsClear) {
     // Force the buffer to clear before it is used.
     EnsureTarget();
@@ -2075,9 +2084,15 @@ }
 already_AddRefed<layers::FwdTransactionTracker>
 CanvasRenderingContext2D::UseCompositableForwarder(
     layers::CompositableForwarder* aForwarder) {
+#if defined(XP_SOLARIS) && (defined(__sparc) || defined(__sparc__))
+  if (auto* provider = GetBufferProvider()) {
+    return provider->UseCompositableForwarder(aForwarder);
+  }
+#else
   if (mBufferProvider) {
     return mBufferProvider->UseCompositableForwarder(aForwarder);
   }
+#endif
   return nullptr;
 }
 
